    "在 AI 平台添加服务，并绑定通话联系人" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Add the service in your AI platform and bind a call contact"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在 API 预设里设置。模型默认不发送思考字段；OpenAI 兼容服务按支持程度选择强度，Anthropic 分自适应强度与手动预算，Gemini 按模型选择强度或预算。提高强度通常会增加等待与用量。Anthropic 最大输出留空时使用 4096；手动思考预算须小于输出上限。摘要同样使用所选 API 预设的输出上限。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Set it in an API preset. Model Default omits thinking fields. OpenAI-compatible services offer supported effort levels; Anthropic offers adaptive effort or a manual budget; Gemini uses effort or budget depending on the model. Higher effort usually increases wait time and usage. Anthropic uses 4096 when max output is blank. Its manual thinking budget must be below the output limit. Summaries also use the output limit of their selected API preset."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在 ChatGPT 添加 MCP 服务时选择 OAuth，将授权页显示的一次性授权码填在这里。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When adding the MCP service in ChatGPT, choose OAuth and enter the one-time code shown on the authorization page here."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ChatGPT で MCP サービスを追加するときに OAuth を選び、許可ページに表示されたワンタイム認証コードをここに入力してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ChatGPT에서 MCP 서비스를 추가할 때 OAuth를 선택하고, 승인 페이지에 표시된 일회용 인증 코드를 여기에 입력하십시오."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 ChatGPT 新增 MCP 服務時選擇 OAuth，將授權頁顯示的一次性授權碼填在這裡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在 Supabase 打开或创建项目。\n更新服务时，请使用此前在这台手机部署的原项目。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Open or create a project in Supabase.\nTo update, use the original project deployed from this iPhone."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Supabase でプロジェクトを開くか作成します。\nサービスを更新するときは、以前この iPhone からデプロイした元のプロジェクトを使ってください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Supabase에서 프로젝트를 열거나 만드십시오.\n서비스를 업데이트할 때는 이전에 이 iPhone에서 배포한 원래 프로젝트를 사용하십시오."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
