        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Create and copy it in Supabase Dashboard → Account Settings → Access Tokens."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在 Supabase 控制台打开项目，点击项目网址右侧的 Copy，在菜单中选择第一项 Project URL，再回到 Tincall 粘贴到下方输入框。也可以直接复制浏览器中的 Supabase 项目页面地址，或只填项目编号。不要复制下面的 API Key。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Open the project in the Supabase dashboard. Click Copy beside the project URL, select the first item, Project URL, then return to Tincall and paste it into the field below. You can also copy the Supabase project page address from your browser or enter just the project reference. Do not copy the API key below it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在 Supabase 控制台打开项目，点击项目网址右侧的 Copy，选择第一项 Project URL，回到这里粘贴。不要复制 API Key。" : {
