    },
    "当前安装包未包含推送权限，暂时只能在 App 打开时接听。后台来电还需要支持推送的签名和云端推送服务。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This build has no push entitlement, so calls can only be answered while the app is open. Background calls also need a push-capable signature and a cloud push service."
