    "想从手机拨号时自动叫醒 TA，要配唤醒桥：AI 平台须提供真实的启动生成和取消接口，由桥调用。Supabase 或 Node 连接端可复用现有服务；自有后端需实现相应桥接。配置方法见仓库 README。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "To wake your AI when calling from your phone, configure a wake bridge. The AI platform must provide real generation and cancellation endpoints for the bridge to call. Supabase or Node connectors can reuse the existing service; custom backends need the corresponding bridge. See the repository README for setup."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "感谢 Silero Team、Microsoft ONNX Runtime 团队、The LAME Project 及各项目贡献者，为本机人声检测、模型运行和音频编码提供支持。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Thank you to the Silero Team, the Microsoft ONNX Runtime team, The LAME Project, and their contributors for supporting on-device speech detection, model execution, and audio encoding."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "端末上での人の声の検出、モデルの実行、音声エンコードを支えてくださっている Silero Team、Microsoft ONNX Runtime チーム、The LAME Project、そして各プロジェクトのコントリビューターの皆さまに感謝します。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "기기 내 음성 감지, 모델 실행, 오디오 인코딩을 지원해 주신 Silero Team, Microsoft ONNX Runtime 팀, The LAME Project 및 각 프로젝트 기여자분들께 감사드립니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "感謝 Silero Team、Microsoft ONNX Runtime 團隊、The LAME Project 及各專案貢獻者，為本機人聲偵測、模型執行和音訊編碼提供支援。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "感谢 すみか 分享 AI 语音通话优化教程，为 Tincall 的流式朗读与切段优化提供参考。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Thank you to すみか for sharing an AI voice call optimization tutorial that informed Tincall’s streaming speech and text segmentation."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI 音声通話の最適化チュートリアルを共有し、Tincall のストリーミング読み上げと分割の最適化の参考になった すみか さんに感謝します。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tincall의 스트리밍 읽기와 분할 최적화에 참고가 된 AI 음성 통화 최적화 튜토리얼을 공유해 주신 すみか 님께 감사드립니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "感謝 すみか 分享 AI 語音通話優化教學，為 Tincall 的串流朗讀與切段優化提供參考。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "慢慢说，我在听。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Take your time. I’m listening."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ゆっくりでいいよ、聞いてるから。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "천천히 말해. 듣고 있어."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "慢慢說，我在聽。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "成功" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Succeeded"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
