    "未完成的操作已保存在本机。继续时沿用原请求，提交结果未确认前不会删除已上传录音。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Unfinished operations are saved on this device. Resuming uses the original request. Uploaded audio is kept until the commit result is confirmed."
