    "请选择完整备份文件夹。保留本机已有联系人和设置，冲突另存。同一通话只导入一次，已存在的记录保留本机版本；按原通话时间由新到旧排列。最多 64 MB 文字与图片、2 GB 录音；不会省略超限内容。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Select the complete backup folder. Existing contacts and settings are kept; conflicts are saved separately. Each call is imported once, keeping the local version of existing records, sorted newest first by original call time. Limits: 64 MB of text and images, and 2 GB of recordings. Content over the limit will not be silently omitted."
          }
        }
      }
    },
