    },
    "通话文字保存在本机，双方录音默认都不保存。可在「数据与备份」中分别开启「保存我的声音」和「保存对方声音」；关闭只停止保存后续录音，已有文件仍保留。\n\n导出备份保存到你选择的文件位置；API 密钥不会随全局备份导出，换设备后需要重新填写。云端同步和录音备份分别开启，不会因为连接云端就自动上传所有内容。\n\n删除本机记录不会自动删除云端副本或已导出的文件。清理前先确认需要保留的备份；导出文件和录音包含隐私，请妥善保管。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Call text is saved on this device. Neither side’s audio is saved by default. Enable Save My Voice and Save Their Voice separately in Data & Backup. Turning them off stops future recordings; existing files remain.\n\nExported backups go to the file location you choose. Full backups exclude API keys, so enter them again on a new device. Cloud sync and audio backup are enabled separately. Connecting a cloud service does not automatically upload everything.\n\nDeleting local records does not delete cloud copies or exported files. Check your backups before clearing data. Exported files and recordings contain private information; store them carefully."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "通话文字保存在本机，双方录音默认都不保存。可在「数据与备份」中分别开启「保存我的声音」和「保存对方声音」；关闭只停止保存后续录音，已有文件仍保留。\n\n本地备份包含联系人、连接配置、个人资料、头像与背景、识别纠错规则、通话文字、消息图片、摘要和已保存录音。API Key 与访问令牌不导出，换设备后需要重新填写。导入字体、通话显示偏好、请求日志和云端的计划／绑定状态不在这份备份中。\n\n云端文字同步和录音备份分别开启，不会因为连接服务就自动上传所有内容。删除本机记录不会自动删除云端副本或已导出的文件。清理前先确认需要保留的备份；导出文件和录音包含隐私，请妥善保管。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Call text is saved locally. Neither side’s audio is saved by default. In Data and Backups, enable Save My Voice and Save the Other Voice separately. Turning either off only stops saving future audio; existing files remain.\n\nLocal backups include contacts, connection settings, your profile, avatars and backgrounds, recognition correction rules, call text, message images, summaries, and retained audio. API keys and access tokens are not exported and must be re-entered on another device. Imported fonts, call display preferences, request logs, and cloud schedules or device bindings are not included.\n\nCloud text sync and audio backups are enabled separately. Connecting a service does not automatically upload everything. Deleting local records does not delete cloud copies or exported files. Keep any backups you need before cleaning up. Exported files and recordings contain private information; store them carefully."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "通话文字保存在本机，双方录音默认都不保存。可在「数据与备份」中分别开启「保存我的声音」和「保存对方声音」；关闭只停止保存后续录音，已有文件仍保留。\n导出备份保存到你选择的文件位置；API 密钥不会随全局备份导出，换设备后需要重新填写。云端同步和录音备份分别开启，不会因为连接云端就自动上传所有内容。\n删除本机记录不会自动删除云端副本或已导出的文件。清理前先确认需要保留的备份；导出文件和录音包含隐私，请妥善保管。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Call text is saved on this device. Neither side’s audio is saved by default. Enable Save My Voice and Save Their Voice separately in Data & Backup. Turning them off stops future recordings; existing files remain.\nExported backups go to the file location you choose. Full backups exclude API keys, so enter them again on a new device. Cloud sync and audio backup are enabled separately. Connecting a cloud service does not automatically upload everything.\nDeleting local records does not delete cloud copies or exported files. Check your backups before clearing data. Exported files and recordings contain private information; store them carefully."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "通话文字保存在本机，双方录音默认都不保存。可在「本机数据与备份」中分别开启「保存我的声音」和「保存对方声音」；关闭只停止保存后续录音，已有文件仍保留。\n\n导出备份保存到你选择的文件位置；API 密钥不会随全局备份导出，换设备后需要重新填写。云端同步和录音备份分别开启，不会因为连接云端就自动上传所有内容。\n\n删除本机记录不会自动删除云端副本或已导出的文件。清理前先确认需要保留的备份；导出文件和录音包含隐私，请妥善保管。" : {
