    },
    "首次部署：先在 Supabase 创建空项目。更新仅支持这台手机原先部署的项目，使用原项目地址，保留原有数据和连接令牌。自行部署的服务请按原部署方式更新。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For a first deployment, create an empty Supabase project. Updates require a project previously deployed by this phone: use its original URL to retain data and connection tokens. Update self-hosted services using their original deployment method."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "首次部署：先在 Supabase 创建空项目。更新仅支持这台手机原先部署的项目，填写原项目地址即可，保留原有数据和连接令牌。自行部署的服务请按原部署方式更新。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For a first deployment, create an empty Supabase project. Updates require a project previously deployed by this phone: enter its original URL to retain data and connection tokens. Update self-hosted services using their original deployment method."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "首次部署：创建空项目并等待就绪。更新：打开此前通过这台手机部署的原项目，数据和连接令牌会保留。通过电脑或服务器部署的服务，请按原方式更新。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For a first deployment, create an empty project and wait until it is ready. To update, open the original project deployed by this phone; data and connection tokens are retained. Update services deployed from a computer or server using the original method."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "首次部署：点上方「打开 Supabase」并登录，选择组织，再点 New project。按页面提示填写项目名称、数据库密码和地区，创建后等待 Supabase 项目就绪。数据库密码不用填到 Tincall。\n\n更新服务：打开此前通过这台手机部署的原 Supabase 项目，不要新建。通过电脑或服务器部署的服务，请前往 GitHub 上的 Tincall 代码仓库获取新版源码，并按原部署方式更新。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "First deployment: tap “Open Supabase” above and sign in. Select an organization, then click New project. Follow the page to enter a project name, database password, and region, then wait until the Supabase project is ready. Do not enter the database password in Tincall.\n\nUpdating: open the original Supabase project previously deployed by this phone instead of creating a new one. For services deployed from a computer or server, get the latest source from the Tincall code repository on GitHub and update using the original deployment method."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "首次部署：点上方「打开 Supabase」并登录，选择自己的组织，再点 New project。按页面提示填写项目名称、数据库密码和地区，创建后等待项目就绪。数据库密码不用填到 Tincall。\n\n更新服务：打开此前通过这台手机部署的原项目，不要新建。通过电脑或服务器部署的服务，请按原方式更新。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "First deployment: tap “Open Supabase” above and sign in. Select your organization, then click New project. Follow the page to enter a project name, database password, and region, then wait until the project is ready. Do not enter the database password in Tincall.\n\nUpdating: open the original project previously deployed by this phone instead of creating a new one. Update services deployed from a computer or server using their original method."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "首次部署：登录 Supabase，选择组织，点击 New project。填写项目名称、数据库密码和地区，创建后等待项目就绪。数据库密码不要填到 Tincall。\n\n更新服务：打开此前通过这台手机部署的原 Supabase 项目，不要新建。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "First deployment: sign in to Supabase, select an organization, and click New project. Enter a project name, database password, and region, then wait until the project is ready. Do not enter the database password in Tincall.\n\nUpdating: open the original Supabase project previously deployed by this phone instead of creating a new one."
          }
